13T12:03:40.373628-08:00", "date_modified": "2026-03-26T17:35:32.096495-07:00", "date_filed": "2026-02-11", "time_filed": null, "entry_number": 59, "recap_sequence_number": "2026-02-11.001", "pacer_sequence_number": 206, "description": "Minute Entry for proceedings held before Judge Eumi K. Lee: Further Case Management Conference held on 2/11/2026. The Court ordered that Attorney Donna Etemadi is personally sanctioned in the amount of $100 (one hundred U.S. dollars), for failing to follow the Court's orders, including the Civil Standing Order, the Case Management Order, and the Courts January 12, 2026 Order (ECF No. 48). Attorney Etemadi further failed to file a response to the order to show cause why sanctions should not issue by the January 28, 2026 deadline (ECF No. 49).Payment shall be directly paid by her personally (and not by her client) within sixty (60) days of the date of this hearing, to the Clerk of the U.S. District Court for the Northern District of California, with a copy of the minutes.The Court admonished Counsel in this action that continued failure to follow court orders may result in further monetary or other sanctions.The Court referred this case for random assignment to a Magistrate Judge for a mandatory settlement conference to be completed by June 1, 2026.Zoom Recording: 1:39 PM - 2:06 PM (27 minutes). Plaintiff Attorney: Donna Etemadi. Defendant Attorney: Adam Knighton. Attachment: Minutes. (lrt, COURT STAFF) (Date Filed: 2/11/2026) (Entered: 02/13/2026)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/453780571/", "id": 453780571, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/69530051/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/468679348/", "id": 468679348, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/69530051/58/nemati-v-tesla-motors-inc/", "date_created": "2026-02-13T00:32:37.929182-08:00", "date_modified": "2026-03-26T17:35:32.191194-07